Comment: 50,0:23:52.95,0:23:52.99,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:17.46,0:00:21.54,Default,MashuLulu,0,0,0,,{\i1}So don't stop chasing it until you smile
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.54,0:00:24.17,Default,MashuLulu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Little singing bird
Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.38,0:00:33.72,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,MashuLulu-san, you exploded in popularity\Nright after you made your debut, yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:33.72,0:00:35.27,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:35.27,0:00:38.23,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Would you say this greatly changed your life?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.23,0:00:39.39,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.77,0:00:43.77,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to have made my debut\Nand to be singing so many lovely songs.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:43.77,0:00:47.69,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I never imagined I could ever be in this position.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:47.69,0:00:49.57,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:49.57,0:00:55.16,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I feel as though I'm slowly becoming\Nsomeone else...
Dialogue: 50,0:00:55.16,0:00:59.75,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,a version of me that's different, and new.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:02.67,0:01:04.25,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Lulu's so lovely!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:04.25,0:01:05.00,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:06.34,0:01:08.38,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Lilly's supposed to show up too after this.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.55,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:02.67,0:01:04.75,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's great to hear!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:04.75,0:01:08.38,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,{\an8}I look forward to seeing your future work.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:11.22,0:01:12.93,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:12.93,0:01:14.43,Default,AD,0,0,0,,Great work today.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:14.43,0:01:15.72,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,You too.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:20.14,0:01:21.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.73,0:01:22.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:22.81,0:01:24.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What's up? You have a gig?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:24.73,0:01:28.19,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes! We just finished filming!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:28.19,0:01:29.40,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:29.40,0:01:32.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to the briefing for {\i1}Rowdy Talk{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.74,0:01:34.16,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.16,0:01:35.16,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.53,0:01:38.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thanks! See you later, Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.41,0:01:39.50,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.50,0:01:42.17,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I'll come pick you up when you're done.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.17,0:01:44.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay! Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.67,0:01:49.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.29,0:03:45.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,G'morning...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.29,0:03:46.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Where's big sis?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.79,0:03:49.25,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Rui went out earlier.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.71,0:03:52.34,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,She's been out a lot lately.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.34,0:03:54.26,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh, really?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.84,0:03:59.26,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Did something good happen to her?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.26,0:04:01.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Bye, Mom!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.10,0:04:02.56,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.43,0:04:07.77,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Another gig?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.77,0:04:11.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's a meeting for a new show!\NSince I'm super popular.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.86,0:04:23.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula! Pam pam power!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.67,0:04:35.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.67,0:04:38.17,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.17,0:04:40.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? Is it just you?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.43,0:04:42.01,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.01,0:04:45.14,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Toko-san asked me to stay here.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.77,0:04:48.31,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.56,0:04:53.23,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wanna wait for her together?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.48,0:04:56.32,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Three sugar cubes, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.78,0:04:59.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. Thank you...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.95,0:05:02.32,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, why so stiff?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.32,0:05:05.12,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You can be casual with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.12,0:05:07.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,U-Um, it's just...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.54,0:05:10.50,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You're a big inspiration to me, Lilly-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.50,0:05:12.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I am?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.38,0:05:15.17,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Y-You're very cute,\Nand everything you do is fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.17,0:05:18.88,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Just looking at you makes me feel happy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.01,0:05:21.13,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.39,0:05:26.97,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You mentioned before\Nthat I inspired you, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.97,0:05:29.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm flattered, but why me?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.06,0:05:33.73,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,When I saw you singing...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.73,0:05:38.07,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,it made me feel deep down\Nthat I wanted to sing like that too.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.07,0:05:42.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? Nah...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.03,0:05:45.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You're way cooler than me!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.03,0:05:48.16,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Not at all! Don't say that...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.25,0:05:57.17,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I enjoy being an idol,\Nbut I dunno what I want to do after this.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.59,0:06:01.84,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ever since I was little,\Nthere's this girl I really loved.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.84,0:06:08.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I really wanted to see her smile,\Nand it ended up turning into a whole thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.14,0:06:13.31,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm not totally sure myself\Nif I'm doing the right thing or not.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.10,0:06:18.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I think you should keep doing this.\NYou're making people smile!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.90,0:06:31.16,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,If I had never met you,\Nthings probably would have never changed.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.54,0:06:40.05,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You opened the door for me, Lilly-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.80,0:06:45.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I see! Then I'll keep going for you, Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.18,0:06:50.72,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ugh, oh boy. I feel so awkward.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.77,0:06:54.94,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,M-Me too, but thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.94,0:06:56.81,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.81,0:07:00.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sorry to ruin the mood here...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.36,0:07:01.78,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,T-T-Toko-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.78,0:07:02.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,How long have you...?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.99,0:07:06.91,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I got here a bit ago,\Nbut you never noticed.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.91,0:07:09.49,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Now I feel awkward too...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.24,0:07:12.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lulu, thanks for watching the place.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.20,0:07:13.58,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,N-No problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.58,0:07:17.08,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Here. It's the script for your next program.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.08,0:07:19.50,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You can head home for the day.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.50,0:07:22.34,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,O-Okay. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.34,0:07:24.88,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You're about to get a lot busier, you two!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.88,0:07:27.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's get to work!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.59,0:07:29.80,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is no time for flirting, you know!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.43,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,We were not!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.16,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm home...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.57,0:07:52.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? It's me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.16,0:07:56.91,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Big sis never watches TV...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.59,0:08:10.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.26,0:08:13.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Fuu.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.64,0:08:20.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis, are you a fan of Lilly?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.90,0:08:25.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Just wondering, since you never watch stuff like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.82,0:08:29.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes, I like her.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.82,0:08:31.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I didn't know!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.66,0:08:34.70,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lilly's super popular at school!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.70,0:08:36.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Isn't she so cool?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.25,0:08:38.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.96,0:08:43.17,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,"Cool" doesn't describe her.\NShe's really amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.17,0:08:44.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.96,0:08:45.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.01,0:08:49.51,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,She {\i1}has{\i0} gained a lot of fans lately.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.51,0:08:52.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,And she's been getting a lot more TV work.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.47,0:08:55.51,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd know about her!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.02,0:09:01.52,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So, what do you like about Lilly, big sis?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.11,0:09:05.02,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Her singing.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.57,0:09:09.95,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Please, it's not all that.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.75,0:09:20.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I want to hear you sing again.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.46,0:09:24.54,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.84,0:09:30.17,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Why not? Your singing was so lovely.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.05,0:09:33.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No it wasn't. I just...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.55,0:09:38.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I mean it! You were such a good singer!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.06,0:09:39.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Better than Lilly, even!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.06,0:09:45.19,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I should know, I listened to you sing so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.19,0:09:47.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This is the truth!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.28,0:09:53.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.57,0:09:55.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Please sing.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.33,0:09:59.58,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's not that simple.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.33,0:10:06.21,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly...-chan...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.96,0:10:10.38,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,is far better than me,\Nbut that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.80,0:10:15.26,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can't sing like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.97,0:10:20.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's not true! I mean it, big sis!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.27,0:10:23.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Because I know all about Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.94,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You don't know anything, Fuu.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.52,0:10:31.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,About me or Lilly-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.36,0:10:36.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I {\i1}do{\i0} know! Because I'm...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.16,0:10:43.21,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm going upstairs.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.18,0:11:02.60,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.02,0:11:06.94,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I've never seen you upset...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.90,0:11:09.57,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I don't get it either.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.11,0:11:12.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to say that...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.99,0:11:14.20,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Rui...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.74,0:11:18.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-chan said she wanted\Nto make everyone smile.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.33,0:11:21.91,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I could never compare to that.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.33,0:11:29.42,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I was really mean to Fuu...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.80,0:11:35.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I just can't tell her!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.55,0:11:39.51,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I know Lilly better than anyone else!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.51,0:11:41.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's why I said what I said!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.77,0:11:45.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I just want big sis...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.48,0:11:47.31,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.98,0:11:50.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Dummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.58,0:12:06.62,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.43,0:12:28.44,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.69,0:12:34.78,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Here, have one.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.78,0:12:36.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm good.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.57,0:12:40.45,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I had a fight with big sis.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.12,0:12:42.99,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Wow, that's rare.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.45,0:12:44.58,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.58,0:12:46.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? No it's not!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.50,0:12:50.67,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm sure you don't feel good.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.50,0:12:54.67,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Did you make up?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.67,0:12:57.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nope, not yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.13,0:12:59.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis went out somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.93,0:13:00.88,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.68,0:13:06.47,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Just wait for now.\NI'm sure you'll get to patch things up later.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.27,0:13:12.15,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Go on, take this.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.15,0:13:14.19,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,It's our new product for this fall.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.95,0:13:29.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm going out to play.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.25,0:13:31.67,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Okay. Have fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.64,0:13:49.64,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Letto!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.77,0:13:55.36,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila, pululila!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.36,0:13:57.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Pop'n pam!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.79,0:14:10.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I want to find something sparkly.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.84,0:14:19.17,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Did it work?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.17,0:14:20.26,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Lulu?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.26,0:14:21.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's go, Azuki.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.63,0:14:22.34,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.94,0:14:35.27,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Going to the agency?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.27,0:14:37.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nope, it's my day off.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.02,0:14:40.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Looking at lots of cute things will cheer me up!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.41,0:14:46.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Aww, cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.66,0:14:48.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This is cute too!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.70,0:14:50.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This looks nice!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.29,0:14:53.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis would look good on this.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.75,0:14:57.08,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.54,0:14:59.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ooh, that looks yummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.59,0:15:01.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Which one should I pick...?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.55,0:15:03.17,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Too many snacks.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.17,0:15:03.84,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.84,0:15:05.88,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,You just ate a manju earlier, no?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.14,0:15:09.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's okay for today! I'm clearing my mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.47,0:15:13.10,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming in!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.10,0:15:15.19,Default,Little Sister,0,0,0,,Big sis, is it good?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.19,0:15:17.02,Default,Big Sister,0,0,0,,Yes, very yummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.06,0:15:21.28,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,You two get along so well.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.28,0:15:22.61,Default,Sisters,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.53,0:15:24.82,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Not getting any?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.82,0:15:26.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.49,0:15:29.37,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I wanted some ice cream...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.50,0:15:41.63,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Got a cavity?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.63,0:15:43.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.21,0:15:46.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I just feel so foggy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.89,0:15:50.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This is so unsatisfying!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.43,0:15:53.47,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.47,0:15:55.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Make my fog go away!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.73,0:15:59.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? That's it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.07,0:16:10.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nothing's changed...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.24,0:16:11.58,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I guess you failed.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.58,0:16:13.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You be quiet.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.25,0:16:18.87,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.87,0:16:21.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh. I'm not having fun yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.00,0:16:23.00,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I'm tired...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.38,0:16:27.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uguisu, you aren't even walking.\NYou've been on my bag all day.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.10,0:16:34.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.47,0:16:36.39,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's a dead end.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Over here too.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.69,0:16:41.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,See? We can't go back to the train.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.10,0:16:42.40,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Darn.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.94,0:16:47.28,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A dead end?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.78,0:16:50.66,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll head that way.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.25,0:17:01.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I guess I'll cross over there.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.47,0:17:09.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.89,0:17:14.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.94,0:17:23.23,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.03,0:17:30.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.20,0:17:32.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's go, before the light changes!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.45,0:17:34.83,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.22,0:17:57.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.35,0:18:02.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That was a surprise.\NI didn't expect to run into you.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.27,0:18:06.11,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Me neither. What brings you out here?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.11,0:18:08.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I came out here to clear my mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.19,0:18:12.86,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Window shopping, looking at cute clothes.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.86,0:18:15.62,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I needed some fresh air too.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.62,0:18:18.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wow! So we're alike!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.41,0:18:22.16,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So, then I found this ice cream shop.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.16,0:18:23.75,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Did you eat there?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.75,0:18:24.71,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.79,0:18:26.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Didn't feel like it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.50,0:18:31.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.67,0:18:32.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.88,0:18:35.64,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You're acting different from yesterday.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.64,0:18:37.68,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Like you're in a bad mood.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.64,0:18:48.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Imagine you had manju you wanted to eat,\Nand you set it aside for later,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.77,0:18:52.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,because you really wanted to have it\Nwith the person you love.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.40,0:18:57.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But then you mess up, and don't get to eat it at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.07,0:18:59.12,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.12,0:19:05.62,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah. I wanted to eat together\Nand have a fun chat, but I ruined it.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.46,0:19:09.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Manju sure don't last long, do they?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.67,0:19:11.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.55,0:19:14.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Do you like sweets?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.09,0:19:17.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hmm... Kinda.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.26,0:19:19.97,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.01,0:19:25.10,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,And I know how you feel.\NI've messed up before too.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.10,0:19:26.81,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You have?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.81,0:19:27.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.98,0:19:33.11,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Like when I can't honestly\Nspeak what's on my mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.11,0:19:35.45,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You're always honest, Lulu-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.03,0:19:40.66,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No, I'm not really that honest at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.41,0:19:42.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.37,0:19:48.17,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can be open when I'm with you, but not usually.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.17,0:19:51.59,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,So I tend to hate myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.96,0:19:54.09,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That happens to me too!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.09,0:19:59.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ever since this morning,\NI've felt all foggy, like, "why?"
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.30,0:20:02.85,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,So we're alike.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.90,0:20:11.31,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,The manju problem is solved now, I think.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.69,0:20:16.57,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I really wanted to eat together,\Nbut I couldn't say it,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.20,0:20:19.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,and then I took my anger out on someone else.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.83,0:20:26.91,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see it now...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.91,0:20:29.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I might've been upset with myself back then.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.72,0:20:40.39,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Don't feel sad, Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.39,0:20:44.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Even if I'm still gloomy myself.\NMaybe that's kinda selfish.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.77,0:20:50.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I think you're pretty honest, Lilly-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.81,0:20:52.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.06,0:20:53.90,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes! And I love that.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.82,0:20:59.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,If you say so, then I'll think it too!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.03,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.16,0:21:04.08,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Talking with you really cheered me up.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.08,0:21:05.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.29,0:21:09.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Me too. You made me feel a lot better.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.96,0:21:11.71,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll try to be open about how I feel.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.34,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Good for them!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.05,0:21:17.38,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Oh, you...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.63,0:21:20.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.34,0:21:23.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,you didn't run away from home, did you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.14,0:21:28.48,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?! I didn't, I swear!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.98,0:21:31.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, okay! That's a relief.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.06,0:21:34.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,'Cause earlier, you just seemed so... y'know.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.56,0:21:36.61,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I swear, it's not like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.99,0:21:45.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm home...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.33,0:21:55.38,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.84,0:21:58.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,H-Hi, I'm back.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.46,0:22:00.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Fuu.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.05,0:22:05.10,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.39,0:22:12.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I-It's okay!
Comment: 50,0:07:45.95,0:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{some of this convo is guesswork since it's obscured behind the main dialogue but it should be simple enough to do}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.95,0:07:48.20,Default,TV Host,0,0,0,,{\an8}You've been busy. Are you resting well?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.20,0:07:49.16,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, plenty!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.16,0:07:51.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}I can rest just about anywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.74,0:07:53.16,Default,TV Host,0,0,0,,{\an8}Do you doze off in dressing rooms?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.16,0:07:54.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sometimes!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.29,0:07:55.37,Default,TV Host,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're even sleeping now.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.37,0:07:56.91,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.50,0:07:59.79,Default,TV Host,0,0,0,,{\an8}Gotcha! I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.79,0:08:01.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}You scared me.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.21,0:08:03.09,Default,TV Host,0,0,0,,{\an8}Did you nap in the dressing room today?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.09,0:08:09.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, not today. I had this really yummy bento lunch!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.82,0:09:11.78,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I take off my sneakers, feeling I've grown
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.78,0:09:15.41,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Bout to head out in my new fit
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.41,0:09:18.95,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Earrings dangling, lip gloss on
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.95,0:09:22.33,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Somehow dazzling even inside
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.33,0:09:25.84,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}It all seemed like a fairy tale on a screen
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.84,0:09:29.26,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Something far, far away I could never reach
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.26,0:09:32.64,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}But I leap onto the crossing, perhaps I'll find my love
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.64,0:09:36.43,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And cast a spell on you
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.43,0:09:37.85,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Sing with me
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.85,0:09:41.19,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Su-Sugar Sugarly La Lu Sugarin'
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.19,0:09:44.77,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'll coat even your sighs in sugar
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.77,0:09:47.53,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Even the same old bustling intersection
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.53,0:09:51.45,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Can become a stage with a touch of magic
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.45,0:09:54.99,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Su-Sugar Sugarly La Lu Sugarin'
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.99,0:09:58.58,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Every lost gaze, come to me
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.58,0:10:04.13,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'll stuff a balloon full of sparkly lights
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.13,0:10:07.92,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And create a wonderland
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.22,0:10:15.47,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'm out in search of thrills{予想もできない　見たこともない}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.47,0:10:19.01,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}That I can't predict, that I've never seen before{トキメキを探しに出かけよう}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.01,0:10:22.39,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Anywhere is my runway, and I can't stop{どこだってランウェイ 止まっちゃダメ}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.39,0:10:25.48,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And I'll take it on as my best self{とっておきの私でいこう}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.48,0:10:29.28,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}When our eyes meet, a shooting star bursts past{目と目が合ったら 飛びだすシューティングスター}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.28,0:10:32.61,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I hope my heartstrings start to twinkle{キラリンみたいなキュンにも期待}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.61,0:10:36.07,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I want to see you, honey, is now a bad time?{出逢いたいHoney 今すぐはムリ？}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.07,0:10:37.95,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'll make it happen with magic{魔法でかなえて}
